# Names only, never values. Real secrets live in Vercel / GitHub settings.
# Where each value goes: docs/SETUP.md. Database, auth and OAuth names arrive in stage 2.

# API listen port (optional, default 3000). Keep 3000 locally: the web dev proxy targets it.
PORT

# Sentry error monitoring (optional; everything is a no-op when unset). DSNs are public client keys.
# DSN of the Sentry project for the API.
SENTRY_DSN
# DSN of the Sentry project for the web app. The API serves it to the browser and tunnels events.
SENTRY_WEB_DSN
# Set by Vercel (not by hand): VERCEL_ENV is the Sentry environment, VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA the release.
